  "bodyHash": "234cba68ef7e09a6",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Immersive Overlays</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-overlays%252fversions%253fl%253dfabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-overlays%252fversions%253fl%253dneoforge%2526l%253dforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cassiancc/Cassians-Badges/refs/heads/main/cozy/NeoForge.svg\" alt=\"forge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/raspberry-flavoured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cassiancc/Cassians-Badges/refs/heads/main/cozy/Raspberry-Flavoured.svg\" alt=\"Raspberry Flavoured\"></a></p>\n<p>本模組將高度可自訂的座標覆蓋層整合為遊戲內機制，僅在玩家持有指南針時才會顯示。此外，它也提供類似的時鐘覆蓋層，用於顯示當前時間。</p>\n<h2>座標覆蓋層</h2>\n<p>只要玩家的背包或儲物袋中包含指南針，即可顯示玩家 X 與 Z 座標的覆蓋層。</p>\n<p>若玩家額外持有可顯示深度的物品，例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a> 的高度計，或來自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns & Chasms</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fspelunkery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spelunkery</a> 等模組的深度計，則也會顯示 Y 座標數值。若無其他物品，僅需指南針即可顯示此覆蓋層。</p>\n<h2>時間與天氣覆蓋層</h2>\n<p>只要玩家的背包或儲物袋中包含時鐘，即可顯示當前時間的覆蓋層。</p>\n<p>若玩家額外持有可顯示天氣的物品，例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns & Chasms</a> 的氣壓計，則也會顯示當前天氣狀況。若無其他物品，僅需時鐘即可顯示此覆蓋層。</p>\n<h2>模組相容性</h2>\n<p>本模組預設支援 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fspelunkery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spelunkery</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns & Chasms</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a> 的物品。對於其他模組，可透過本模組的各項設定選項來新增對應物品。</p>\n<h2>風力覆蓋層</h2>\n<p>只要玩家的背包或儲物袋中包含風速計，即可顯示風力強度與方向的覆蓋層。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbreezy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Breezy</a> 後，此資料將來源於風速計。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<p>本模組的概念源自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fnoelledotjpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nöelle</a> 為 Raspberry Flavoured 所開發的原型。我將此概念帶入我的模組 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fraspberry-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raspberry Core</a> 中進行實作與改良，最終在此定型為 Immersive Overlays。</p>\n<p>貼圖與模組圖示亦由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fnoelledotjpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nöelle</a> 製作。</p>\n<p>溫度覆蓋層與季節覆蓋層的貼圖由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProbablyEkho\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ProbablyEkho</a> 製作。</p>\n<p>No Man's Land、Abundant Atmosphere 與 New World 生物群系覆蓋層的貼圖由 KevBo 製作。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
